# Obsidian Markdown Links

- Write note links as standard Markdown links, not Obsidian `[[wikilinks]]`.
- Use relative paths to the target note and keep the `.md` extension.
- Preserve a readable label. For alias-style links, use the alias as the link text.
- When editing existing notes, convert new or touched wikilinks to Markdown links instead of adding more wikilinks.

Examples:

- Use `[Authentication](Authentication.md)` instead of `[[Authentication]]`.
- Use `[transaction](Transaction%20boundary.md)` instead of `[[Transaction boundary|transaction]]`.
